OL,3,CFamily of Caitlin Green continue to
OL,4,Cseek answers after her death in Lurgan
OL,6,FThe family of 24-year-old Caitlin
OL,7,FGreen, whose body was found in Lurgan
OL,8,Fearlier this year, say they're still
OL,9,Fsearching for answers.
OL,11,FStephanie Green, Caitlin's mother,
OL,12,Fbelieves the circumstances surrounding
OL,13,Fher daughter's death were not
OL,14,Fthoroughly investigated by the PSNI.
OL,16,FCaitlin who was from Gilford in Co
OL,17,FDown went missing at the end of
OL,18,FJanuary this year.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/6
