OL,3,CFamily of Caitlin Green continue to
OL,4,Cseek answers after her death in Lurgan
OL,6,FA week later, her body was discovered
OL,7,Fin a hedge at the back of houses, just
OL,8,Foff Princess Street in Lurgan.
OL,10,FThe PSNI has said her death is not
OL,11,Fbeing treated as suspicious.
OL,13,FBut for Caitlin's family, questions
OL,14,Fremain.
OL,16,FHer mother has spoken to UTV about her
OL,17,Fdaughter and the life she lived, as
OL,18,Fthe family continues to grieve her
OL,19,Floss.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/6
