OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786450702
OL,3,CFamily of Caitlin Green continue to
OL,4,Cseek answers after her death in Lurgan
OL,6,FThe family has also raised concerns
OL,7,Fabout what they believe was a delayed
OL,8,Fresponse to Caitlin's disappearance,
OL,9,Fincluding the decision not to classify
OL,10,Fher as high-risk sooner.
OL,12,FThe PSNI said its thoughts remain with
OL,13,FCaitlin's family and loved ones.
OL,15,FIn a statement, it said officers had
OL,16,Fconducted "robust and thorough
OL,17,Fenquiries" from the outset of the
OL,18,Finvestigation, with assistance from
OL,19,Fspecialist trained police search teams
OL,20,Fand detectives from its Serious Crime
OL,21,FBranch.
OL,26,@xD@KOUyD@JO]
