OL,3,CFamily of Caitlin Green continue to
OL,4,Cseek answers after her death in Lurgan
OL,6,FPolice said they have met with
OL,7,FCaitlin's family on a number of
OL,8,Foccasions and will continue to engage
OL,9,Fwith them throughout the proceedings.
OL,11,FFollowing a post-mortem examination,
OL,12,FCaitlin's death was deemed not
OL,13,Fsuspicious.
OL,15,FThe PSNI said that, as coronial
OL,16,Fenquiries are ongoing, it would be
OL,17,Finappropriate to comment further on
OL,18,Fspecific aspects of the investigation.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/6
