OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786450702
OL,3,CFamily of Caitlin Green continue to
OL,4,Cseek answers after her death in Lurgan
OL,6,FThe Police Ombudsman is also
OL,7,Finvestigating a complaint relating to
OL,8,Fthe circumstances surrounding
OL,9,FCaitlin's death.
OL,11,FThe Ombudsman said it would not
OL,12,Fcomment on the detail of the
OL,13,Finvestigation while it remains ongoing.
OL,15,FOn Saturday, friends, family and
OL,16,Fsupporters came together to remember
OL,17,FCaitlin.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/6
