OL,3,CFamily of Caitlin Green continue to
OL,4,Cseek answers after her death in Lurgan
OL,6,FA 26-mile walk was held in her memory,
OL,7,Fwith money raised for the Community
OL,8,FRescue Service, which helped in the
OL,9,Fsearch for her following her
OL,10,Fdisappearance.
OL,12,FFor those who took part, the event was
OL,13,Fa way to honour Caitlin and show their
OL,14,Fsupport for her family.
